        <mxCell id="mod-notes" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;Each module follows: &lt;b&gt;Route&lt;/b&gt; (express-validator) &amp;rarr; &lt;b&gt;Controller&lt;/b&gt; (req/res) &amp;rarr; &lt;b&gt;Service&lt;/b&gt; (business logic) &amp;rarr; &lt;b&gt;Model&lt;/b&gt; (Mongoose schema)&lt;br&gt;Protected routes use &lt;b&gt;auth middleware&lt;/b&gt; (JWT). Admin routes add &lt;b&gt;roleCheck middleware&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
