        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flow-steps" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;&quot;&gt;1. Client sends HTTP request&lt;br&gt;2. Middleware (CORS, Logger, Parser)&lt;br&gt;3. Auth middleware (JWT verify)&lt;br&gt;4. Validation middleware (express-validator)&lt;br&gt;5. Route matches controller&lt;br&gt;6. Controller calls service&lt;br&gt;7. Service queries Mongoose model&lt;br&gt;8. MongoDB returns data&lt;br&gt;9. Response sent to client&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="354" width="300" height="170" as="geometry" />
